      "file": "site/manual/index.html",
      "note": "The manual opens the way the CROBOTS manual did: with a whole robot you can paste in and run, then a plain walk through each line. Scout drives east, looks east, and fires whenever it sees something. It's short enough to read in a minute and complete enough to fight.",
